- Check VOCAB_ALIASES.json maps F0 aliases strong_cosmic_censorship_C2/_C0 -> canonical; crosswalk artifact exists (find a pinned crosswalk file); the consistency checker script exists and its check compares schema tokens to VOCAB_ALIASES canonical mapping rather than F0 raw alias list (grep for sourcing). This one is more complex; I can measure: (a) schema tokens canonical; (b) VOCAB_ALIASES has alias→canonical mapping for both; (c) some crosswalk artifact declares F0 alias entries; (d) run the live consistency checker and record exit.
